{"id":"283c19abd035c9ac","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-grz-translation.md","title":"Grz Translation and Arithmetical Completeness","display":"thm-grz-translation — Grz Translation and Arithmetical Completeness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-grz-translation","aliases":["89-thm-grz-translation"],"display":"thm-grz-translation — Grz Translation and Arithmetical Completeness","depends_on":["[[89-df-grz-logic]]","[[89-df-dotted-translation]]","[[89-thm-solovay-theorem]]","[[89-thm-gls-completeness]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-grz-translation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-grz-translation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-grz-translation — Grz Translation and Arithmetical Completeness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e67bc8e485daa168\" href=\"?note=e67bc8e485daa168\" title=\"89-df-grz-logic\">89-df-grz-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3fc95f0f8defc51d\" href=\"?note=3fc95f0f8defc51d\" title=\"89-df-dotted-translation\">89-df-dotted-translation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"be68cce492414c6b\" href=\"?note=be68cce492414c6b\" title=\"89-thm-solovay-theorem\">89-thm-solovay-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9e926c452321080c\" href=\"?note=9e926c452321080c\" title=\"89-thm-gls-completeness\">89-thm-gls-completeness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Grz},\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{GLS}\">\\(\\mathrm{Grz},\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{GLS}\\)</span> 为各自定理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 是递归 dotted 翻译；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 为普通 PA 可证明性实现集。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}grz\\text{-}translation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nA\\in\\mathrm{Grz}\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow d(A)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\\n(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\tau(d(A)))\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow d(A)\\in\\mathrm{GLS}\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\\n(\\mathbb N\\models\\tau(d(A))).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}grz\\text{-}translation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nA\\in\\mathrm{Grz}\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow d(A)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\\n(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\tau(d(A)))\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow d(A)\\in\\mathrm{GLS}\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\\n(\\mathbb N\\models\\tau(d(A))).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 12 章，印刷页 155–164；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n引用原书 Theorem 1 及其证明。这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(d(A))\">\\(\\tau(d(A))\\)</span> 解释的是递归的“可证且成立”；不是直接 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(A)\">\\(\\tau(A)\\)</span> 的普通盒解释。因此不把 Grz 与普通总为真逻辑 GLS 混同，也不把所有 GLS 公式声称为 GL 定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-grz-logic","status":"resolved","id":"e67bc8e485daa168","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-grz-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-dotted-translation","status":"resolved","id":"3fc95f0f8defc51d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-dotted-translation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-solovay-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"be68cce492414c6b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-solovay-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-gls-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"9e926c452321080c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-gls-completeness]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Grz},\\mathrm{GL},\\mathrm{GLS}","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}grz\\text{-}translation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nA\\in\\mathrm{Grz}\n&\\Longleftrightarrow d(A)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\\\\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\\n(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\tau(d(A)))\\\\\n&\\Longleftrightarrow d(A)\\in\\mathrm{GLS}\\\\\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\\n(\\mathbb N\\models\\tau(d(A))).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau(d(A))","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(A)","display":false}],"bytes":1535,"backlinks":[{"id":"dbeebd3188fb9a4d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"它的算术解释使用 $\\Box^+$（可证并且该句子成立）的递归翻译，见 [[89-thm-grz-translation]]。普通可证明性解释下的总为真逻辑是 GLS。"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-144","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-grz-logic]] → [[89-df-dotted-translation]] → [[89-df-grz-frame]] → [[89-thm-grz-frame-completeness]] → [[89-thm-grz-translation]]"}],"outgoing":["e67bc8e485daa168","3fc95f0f8defc51d","be68cce492414c6b","9e926c452321080c"]}